<BaseLayout title="About — nSealr" description="A focused offline signer for Nostr."><article class="container prose" style="padding-block:48px;max-width:800px"><h1>One identity. Under your control.</h1><p>nSealr helps you use a Nostr identity while keeping its private key on an offline device.</p><p>The device owns key use and local approval. The companion connects it to clients. The source is open so you can inspect, build and improve it.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/nSealr/nsealr">Explore the project →</a></p></article></BaseLayout>
